1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:16,000
Soul. Nature. Succession. Succession.

2
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Where am I? Are those stars? So pretty.

3
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Not quite stars. The crystallized dualium is resonating with your soul and shining.

4
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:38,000
Tsubasa-san?

5
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:42,000
Your fever seems to have come down.

6
00:00:42,000 --> 00:00:48,000
I'm going to become a successor, aren't I?

7
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:14,000
I'm going to become a successor.

8
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:16,000
I'm going to become a successor.

9
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:18,000
I'm going to become a successor.

10
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:20,000
I'm going to become a successor.

11
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:22,000
I'm going to become a successor.

12
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:24,000
I'm going to become a successor.

13
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:26,000
I'm going to become a successor.

14
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:31,000
I'm going to become a successor.

15
00:01:31,000 --> 00:02:00,980
See you next time.

16
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:30,980
See you next time.

17
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:33,620
I thought you'd gone crazy from the pressure.

18
00:02:34,060 --> 00:02:35,540
Yeah, I was surprised.

19
00:02:36,420 --> 00:02:38,860
I was more or less thinking out loud.

20
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:39,320
Really?

21
00:02:39,840 --> 00:02:41,640
So you weren't serious then?

22
00:02:42,280 --> 00:02:43,500
Yes, I was.

23
00:02:43,800 --> 00:02:45,040
Super serious.

24
00:02:45,860 --> 00:02:46,420
Good.

25
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:50,720
What's wrong, Kaneda-san?

26
00:02:51,420 --> 00:02:52,880
Soneda, you seem down.

27
00:02:53,320 --> 00:02:57,380
Well, I'm wondering if Memori's all right.

28
00:02:59,680 --> 00:03:03,240
They took her to the hospital after she collapsed backstage.

29
00:03:04,200 --> 00:03:05,380
So scary.

30
00:03:05,920 --> 00:03:07,080
Is she still all shaky?

31
00:03:07,840 --> 00:03:09,900
I'm sure she's just fine, Sonati.

32
00:03:10,420 --> 00:03:10,960
Chin up.

33
00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:12,300
She'll be better soon.

34
00:03:12,540 --> 00:03:13,620
Good, you're all here.

35
00:03:14,540 --> 00:03:16,100
I have a message from management.

36
00:03:16,920 --> 00:03:19,020
There's been a change of plans for the next concert.

37
00:03:19,020 --> 00:03:28,500
And the main concert will be performed only by successors instead of elected members.

38
00:03:29,340 --> 00:03:33,240
That's because the next concert will be an incredibly special event.

39
00:03:35,200 --> 00:03:37,240
Memori Kishida's Succession Concert.

40
00:03:37,240 --> 00:03:39,340
Memori's Revolution.

41
00:03:42,280 --> 00:03:45,200
Memori's Succession Concert?

42
00:03:45,380 --> 00:03:46,160
Oh, wait!

43
00:03:46,740 --> 00:03:47,720
She's a successor.

44
00:03:48,220 --> 00:03:49,340
That's amazing!

45
00:03:49,960 --> 00:03:51,120
Succession, succession!

46
00:03:51,440 --> 00:03:53,960
That sounds a lot like Chashu Ramen.

47
00:03:54,500 --> 00:03:55,560
Now I'm hungry.

48
00:03:55,800 --> 00:03:57,760
Hey, I'm the one from the comedy planet.

49
00:03:58,760 --> 00:04:00,680
Don't you all seem excited?

50
00:04:01,060 --> 00:04:02,920
Talking about Memori's Succession?

51
00:04:03,440 --> 00:04:04,220
Cool, huh?

52
00:04:04,480 --> 00:04:06,040
She's the first one, Sensei.

53
00:04:06,040 --> 00:04:08,120
I know, it's such wonderful news.

54
00:04:08,360 --> 00:04:09,860
Chanmi's becoming a successor.

55
00:04:10,420 --> 00:04:12,000
Good call, good call.

56
00:04:12,120 --> 00:04:12,540
Big Sis!

57
00:04:13,200 --> 00:04:14,480
Memori really did it!

58
00:04:15,020 --> 00:04:15,240
Mm.

59
00:04:16,000 --> 00:04:16,320
Huh?

60
00:04:16,840 --> 00:04:18,380
I'm sorry, Big Sis.

61
00:04:19,160 --> 00:04:21,100
Hey, don't worry about me, kiddo.

62
00:04:21,320 --> 00:04:23,020
We've got to congratulate Memori.

63
00:04:23,460 --> 00:04:24,220
Yes, ma'am!

64
00:04:27,480 --> 00:04:31,600
Memori and Tsubasa will be busy with their own preparations before the Succession Concert.

65
00:04:32,080 --> 00:04:33,240
You'll be starting your lessons.

66
00:04:33,900 --> 00:04:35,220
There's no time to lose.

67
00:04:35,220 --> 00:04:35,860
Right!

68
00:04:36,040 --> 00:04:38,260
Guess that means we should start practicing, too.

69
00:04:38,660 --> 00:04:39,020
Okay!

70
00:04:40,300 --> 00:04:41,260
The Successor's...

71
00:04:42,260 --> 00:04:43,140
Not Jerry?

72
00:04:45,040 --> 00:04:50,440
Earlier today, an announcement confirming the Succession of elected member Memori Kishida was made.

73
00:04:50,620 --> 00:04:55,360
Many loyal fans are excited to see the first Successor from the unlucky 75th generation.

74
00:04:55,820 --> 00:04:56,980
This is amazing!

75
00:04:56,980 --> 00:05:00,480
I heard the tickets are worth 168 times their normal value.

76
00:05:01,200 --> 00:05:02,860
Succession Concerts are rare.

77
00:05:03,400 --> 00:05:05,020
It's a once-in-a-lifetime deal.

78
00:05:05,640 --> 00:05:08,560
So it's only natural the tickets are in such high demand.

79
00:05:09,040 --> 00:05:11,640
Look, there are predictions for Memori's Succession!

80
00:05:11,640 --> 00:05:12,180
What?

81
00:05:12,180 --> 00:05:12,280
What?

82
00:05:12,280 --> 00:05:12,900
Really?

83
00:05:12,900 --> 00:05:12,980
Really?

84
00:05:12,980 --> 00:05:15,980
Oh, that's amazing!

85
00:05:15,980 --> 00:05:19,200
I wonder who Memori-san's going to succeed!

86
00:05:19,200 --> 00:05:22,200
We won't know until the concert.

87
00:05:22,200 --> 00:05:24,420
Even the members are kept in the dark about it.

88
00:05:24,420 --> 00:05:26,640
No more Memori, huh?

89
00:05:26,640 --> 00:05:27,640
Gosh!

90
00:05:27,640 --> 00:05:28,640
Say what?

91
00:05:28,640 --> 00:05:32,780
Sorry, I was just thinking about what will happen to Memori after this.

92
00:05:32,780 --> 00:05:35,600
She'll succeed the name of an original member.

93
00:05:36,640 --> 00:05:41,700
But it also means she'll have to throw away the name she's used until now and become a different person.

94
00:05:41,700 --> 00:05:44,980
I can't imagine what losing your name must be like.

95
00:05:44,980 --> 00:05:46,700
It changes everything.

96
00:05:48,200 --> 00:05:49,320
Trust me, I know.

97
00:05:49,320 --> 00:05:53,000
I watched the moment Yoko became the 10th generation's same Miyazawa.

98
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:56,900
Megumi-san, you make it sound like she transformed or something!

99
00:05:56,900 --> 00:06:00,360
In a way she did, and Memori will do the same thing.

100
00:06:00,360 --> 00:06:04,120
Well, we'll see what happens once she becomes a successor.

101
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:05,160
Mmm!

102
00:06:05,160 --> 00:06:09,040
Do you really think Memori's going to change on us?

103
00:06:09,040 --> 00:06:11,520
She may even become a cold and heartless person.

104
00:06:11,520 --> 00:06:13,300
Don't say that!

105
00:06:13,300 --> 00:06:14,880
Maybe she'll be a sadist.

106
00:06:14,880 --> 00:06:17,340
You don't think she'll forget about us, do you?

107
00:06:17,340 --> 00:06:22,780
The only thing we can be sure of is that we have no clue what happens when someone becomes a successor.

108
00:06:26,900 --> 00:06:29,860
I really looked up to her.

109
00:06:29,860 --> 00:06:35,120
As a girl who wanted to become an idol, I wanted to take on the name of the original Yuki Kashiwagi.

110
00:06:35,120 --> 00:06:38,620
I was so happy to actually succeed her.

111
00:06:38,620 --> 00:06:40,660
It was a dream come true!

112
00:06:40,660 --> 00:06:45,120
But at the same time, I felt the weight of the responsibility of her name.

113
00:06:45,120 --> 00:06:50,580
Oh yeah, I've changed.

114
00:06:50,580 --> 00:06:55,140
The quality of my gravure shoots, the level of my performances on stage, all different

115
00:06:55,140 --> 00:06:57,340
from when I was a trainee.

116
00:06:57,340 --> 00:07:06,120
Well, it just means I sleep less and eat a lot more.

117
00:07:06,120 --> 00:07:17,300
When I succeeded the 9th generation Oshima Yuko, the 13th generation Achan was still shining

118
00:07:17,300 --> 00:07:19,140
bright.

119
00:07:19,140 --> 00:07:22,120
She was a blinding light that stood out.

120
00:07:22,120 --> 00:07:23,740
I looked up to her.

121
00:07:23,740 --> 00:07:25,600
She was my rival.

122
00:07:25,600 --> 00:07:30,820
I thought I could finally compete with her on the same stage once I became a successor.

123
00:07:30,820 --> 00:07:35,340
But Achan disappeared somewhere.

124
00:07:35,340 --> 00:07:39,020
The current Zero-Zero, I think it's awesome.

125
00:07:39,020 --> 00:07:43,180
All the members get along, and the trainees are progressing nicely.

126
00:07:43,180 --> 00:07:46,660
And most of all, I know I'll become Center Nova.

127
00:07:46,660 --> 00:07:50,840
Just you watch.

128
00:07:50,840 --> 00:07:55,240
The preparations for Succession should be coming along underneath the stage.

129
00:07:55,240 --> 00:08:00,560
At yesterday's concert, I even measured a tremendous amount of dualium.

130
00:08:00,560 --> 00:08:06,240
If this keeps up, I should be able to find the last piece necessary for triggering the Center

131
00:08:06,240 --> 00:08:08,240
Nova phenomenon soon.

132
00:08:08,240 --> 00:08:18,760
You're coming along nicely.

133
00:08:18,760 --> 00:08:21,260
I guess your Succession fever broke?

134
00:08:21,260 --> 00:08:22,920
Succession fever?

135
00:08:22,920 --> 00:08:28,600
It's the high fever you experience as a reaction to your soul's aligning.

136
00:08:28,600 --> 00:08:35,600
But to think, you would succeed her name.

137
00:08:35,600 --> 00:08:40,280
Huh?

138
00:08:40,280 --> 00:08:57,960
Let's both become successors as soon as we can, okay?

139
00:08:57,960 --> 00:09:02,640
I'm the last of the unlucky 75th generation.

140
00:09:02,640 --> 00:09:04,640
What am I lacking?

141
00:09:04,640 --> 00:09:07,640
Why can't I become a successor?

142
00:09:07,640 --> 00:09:08,640
Ah!

143
00:09:08,640 --> 00:09:10,640
T-Tagamina-san!

144
00:09:10,640 --> 00:09:12,640
You have to take a break sometime, right?

145
00:09:12,640 --> 00:09:13,640
Here.

146
00:09:13,640 --> 00:09:15,640
Pull-

147
00:09:15,640 --> 00:09:17,320
Thank you very much.

148
00:09:22,320 --> 00:09:24,720
It's the Succession concert for one of my best friends.

149
00:09:24,720 --> 00:09:26,680
I want to make sure we open the show with a bang.

150
00:09:26,680 --> 00:09:28,520
That's why I'm busting my tail.

151
00:09:28,520 --> 00:09:29,520
Haha.

152
00:09:30,520 --> 00:09:31,520
Kanata?

153
00:09:32,600 --> 00:09:35,520
Well, I hope Memori feels better soon.

154
00:09:36,120 --> 00:09:37,320
Ah, she'll be fine.

155
00:09:37,320 --> 00:09:40,800
I had a similar fever before, but it went away pretty quick.

156
00:09:40,800 --> 00:09:41,440
She's tough.

157
00:09:41,440 --> 00:09:42,960
She'll pull out of it.

158
00:09:42,960 --> 00:09:49,240
And besides, Memori's the big star of the next concert.

159
00:09:49,240 --> 00:09:54,240
Either she walks out there, or I'll carry her on stage myself.

160
00:09:54,240 --> 00:09:58,440
It's always impressed me how you put your fans and your friends before your own needs.

161
00:09:58,440 --> 00:10:00,440
Truly.

162
00:10:00,440 --> 00:10:04,120
Just like the first Manami Takahashi.

163
00:10:04,120 --> 00:10:05,280
Huh?

164
00:10:05,280 --> 00:10:09,880
I hope this doesn't sound weird, but hypothetically speaking,

165
00:10:09,880 --> 00:10:14,160
if you already had the capacity to become a successor, would you?

166
00:10:14,160 --> 00:10:18,440
Takamina-san?

167
00:10:18,440 --> 00:10:20,440
What are you asking me?

168
00:10:20,440 --> 00:10:26,440
If you could become the sixth generation Manami Takahashi, what would you do?

169
00:10:26,440 --> 00:10:28,440
Takamina-san?

170
00:10:28,440 --> 00:10:34,720
Kanata, you have the capacity, strength, and soul to become a successor.

171
00:10:34,720 --> 00:10:36,720
I have no doubt of that.

172
00:10:36,720 --> 00:10:37,720
I have no doubt of that.

173
00:10:37,720 --> 00:10:43,000
So then, what if I'm the reason you can't do that?

174
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:45,280
Why would you even think that?

175
00:10:45,280 --> 00:10:47,280
I just wanted to ask.

176
00:10:47,280 --> 00:10:48,280
Uh…

177
00:10:48,280 --> 00:10:49,280
Uh…

178
00:10:49,280 --> 00:10:51,280
Answer this.

179
00:10:51,280 --> 00:10:57,560
If you could do it, if you could do it, would you force me out and become a successor,

180
00:10:57,560 --> 00:11:00,560
so you could become a Manami Takahashi?

181
00:11:00,560 --> 00:11:01,560
Takamina…

182
00:11:01,560 --> 00:11:04,560
You couldn't?

183
00:11:04,560 --> 00:11:07,720
I don't know.

184
00:11:07,720 --> 00:11:12,320
The name's important to me, just as important as your friendship is.

185
00:11:12,320 --> 00:11:18,040
If I had to choose… I'm not sure what I would decide.

186
00:11:18,040 --> 00:11:24,320
Uh… I see…

187
00:11:24,320 --> 00:11:25,320
Good morning!

188
00:11:25,320 --> 00:11:29,720
What happened?

189
00:11:29,720 --> 00:11:31,280
Did you two stay up all night?

190
00:11:31,280 --> 00:11:32,280
Yeah…

191
00:11:32,280 --> 00:11:35,120
I couldn't stop thinking about what Magumi-san said yesterday.

192
00:11:35,120 --> 00:11:37,600
Magumi-san is a big dumb meanie!

193
00:11:37,600 --> 00:11:41,600
I was wondering if Mamori-san really will become a different person.

194
00:11:41,600 --> 00:11:44,360
I was so worried I couldn't sleep at all.

195
00:11:44,360 --> 00:11:46,440
You worry too much.

196
00:11:46,440 --> 00:11:47,440
Here, take a look at this!

197
00:11:47,440 --> 00:11:48,440
Huh?

198
00:11:48,440 --> 00:11:49,440
Wait…

199
00:11:49,440 --> 00:11:52,720
Are those… messages from Mamori's fans?

200
00:11:52,720 --> 00:11:53,720
Oh!

201
00:11:53,720 --> 00:11:55,720
Thank you for replying to my letter.

202
00:11:55,720 --> 00:11:58,720
It's my greatest treasure in the whole world.

203
00:11:58,720 --> 00:12:01,720
I hope you'll let me be your fan forever.

204
00:12:01,720 --> 00:12:03,720
Don't you worry.

205
00:12:03,720 --> 00:12:04,720
She's not changing.

206
00:12:04,720 --> 00:12:05,720
Huh?

207
00:12:05,720 --> 00:12:11,160
There's no way someone who loves her fans like that and is loved in return could ever change.

208
00:12:11,160 --> 00:12:12,160
You think so?

209
00:12:12,160 --> 00:12:13,160
Mm-hmm.

210
00:12:13,160 --> 00:12:14,440
I don't know.

211
00:12:14,440 --> 00:12:15,440
I do.

212
00:12:15,440 --> 00:12:16,440
She'll be just fine.

213
00:12:16,440 --> 00:12:17,440
Oh, really?

214
00:12:17,440 --> 00:12:18,440
Then let's celebrate!

215
00:12:18,440 --> 00:12:19,440
Huh?

216
00:12:19,440 --> 00:12:20,440
Let's celebrate her birthday!

217
00:12:20,440 --> 00:12:21,440
That's a great idea.

218
00:12:21,440 --> 00:12:29,720
It's the birth of a new Mamori-san and we should welcome her the best way we can.

219
00:12:29,720 --> 00:12:30,720
You know I'm all in for it!

220
00:12:30,720 --> 00:12:31,720
Mm-hmm!

221
00:12:31,720 --> 00:12:32,720
Let's do it!

222
00:12:32,720 --> 00:12:33,720
I agree!

223
00:12:33,720 --> 00:12:34,720
Cool!

224
00:12:34,720 --> 00:12:36,720
Then we're throwing her a party!

225
00:12:36,720 --> 00:12:37,720
Yeah!

226
00:12:37,720 --> 00:12:44,720
See you all later!

227
00:12:44,720 --> 00:12:48,900
The current Zero-Zero, I think it's awesome.

228
00:12:48,900 --> 00:12:53,440
All the members get along and the trainees are progressing nicely.

229
00:12:53,440 --> 00:12:56,440
And most of all, I know I'll become Center Nova.

230
00:12:56,440 --> 00:12:58,240
Just you watch!

231
00:12:58,240 --> 00:13:00,320
I became the center.

232
00:13:00,320 --> 00:13:05,120
I have amazing rivals and our concerts are always a huge hit.

233
00:13:05,120 --> 00:13:08,120
But there's still something missing.

234
00:13:08,120 --> 00:13:11,120
There was... a bright light.

235
00:13:11,120 --> 00:13:13,120
So bright it was blinding.

236
00:13:13,120 --> 00:13:18,120
It was so close to us, but somehow seemed distant and unreachable.

237
00:13:18,120 --> 00:13:21,120
That was a 13th generation Achan.

238
00:13:21,120 --> 00:13:22,120
Alone?

239
00:13:22,120 --> 00:13:24,120
She may have been.

240
00:13:24,120 --> 00:13:28,120
Especially once she became the center Nova.

241
00:13:28,120 --> 00:13:31,120
It seems presumptuous to think I could support her.

242
00:13:31,120 --> 00:13:36,120
But I had succeeded Manami Takahashi, the Zero-Zero 48 captain.

243
00:13:36,120 --> 00:13:39,120
I thought I needed to change things about myself.

244
00:13:39,120 --> 00:13:42,120
I needed to be strong enough to support Achan.

245
00:13:42,120 --> 00:13:44,120
I still have a long way to go.

246
00:13:44,120 --> 00:13:46,120
You always know what to say.

247
00:13:46,120 --> 00:13:48,120
I really envy that.

248
00:13:48,120 --> 00:13:55,120
I'm the one who needs to become stronger.

249
00:13:55,120 --> 00:13:56,120
Ugh!

250
00:13:56,120 --> 00:13:57,120
Ugh!

251
00:13:57,120 --> 00:14:00,120
This will be the last time I come here.

252
00:14:00,120 --> 00:14:01,120
Later!

253
00:14:01,120 --> 00:14:16,120
Is Mamori still not here?

254
00:14:16,120 --> 00:14:17,120
She'll make it.

255
00:14:17,120 --> 00:14:18,120
Don't worry.

256
00:14:18,120 --> 00:14:19,120
So...

257
00:14:19,120 --> 00:14:21,120
Is she not gonna rehearse at all?

258
00:14:21,120 --> 00:14:24,120
It's almost time.

259
00:14:24,120 --> 00:14:27,120
Are you ready?

260
00:14:27,120 --> 00:14:29,120
Mamori?

261
00:14:29,120 --> 00:14:32,120
Sayaka-san told me before.

262
00:14:32,120 --> 00:14:39,120
Zero-Zero is a place where you work hard to become someone you are not.

263
00:14:39,120 --> 00:14:42,120
I am ready to change.

264
00:14:42,120 --> 00:14:44,120
Where else?

265
00:14:44,120 --> 00:14:47,120
At least she'll never make a product of your dream

266
00:14:47,120 --> 00:14:49,120
It's now one place all around her.

267
00:14:49,120 --> 00:14:51,120
There it is.

268
00:14:51,120 --> 00:14:52,120
An insecticore isкої.

269
00:14:52,120 --> 00:15:06,120
It's very.

